        <field name="publisher">Canada Revenue Agency</field>
        <field
            name="reference"
        >Steps 4 and 5 (T4, K1P, K2P, T2), Ontario section (V1, V2, S), bonus formulas (TB); Ontario tables unchanged from the 122nd edition (January 2026), tables 8.1 and 8.2</field>
