        <field
            name="reference"
        >S. 1(1) (remuneration, total Ontario remuneration), 2(2) and table (rates), 2.1 (exemption, threshold, associated employers, charities), 3 (instalments), 5 (annual return)</field>
        <field name="url">https://www.ontario.ca/laws/statute/90e11</field>
        <field
            name="summary"
        >EHT rates from 0.98% to 1.95% chosen by the total Ontario remuneration, exemption of 1,000,000 for 2020 to 2028, exemption threshold of 5,000,000, monthly instalments above 1,200,000 and annual return due March 15.</field>
