        <field name="publisher">Ontario Ministry of Finance</field>
        <field
            name="reference"
        >Rate basis, exemption, instalments, annual return; subpages associated employers, remuneration and filing how-tos</field>
        <field
            name="url"
        >https://www.ontario.ca/document/employer-health-tax-eht</field>
        <field
            name="summary"
        >The rate is based on the Ontario payroll before the exemption, all accounts combined; instalments are due on the 15th of the month after the payroll once the cumulative payroll exceeds 1.2 million; the return and balance are due on or before March 15.</field>
